nt":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-15T07:17:43Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2801677608,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDI4MDE2Nzc2MDg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/2801677608","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-15T07:17:43Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/554265932","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6646#issuecomment-554265932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6646","id":554265932,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1NDI2NTkzMg==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-15T08:38:37Z","updated_at":"2019-11-15T08:40:07Z","body":"Thanks! I can reproduce this. You're right - What's happening is that the two videos have the same resolution, but have different pixel aspect ratios. In `MediaCodecVideoRenderer` there's a new input format, but because the resolution is unchanged there's no format change on the output side of the decoder. This means that the new pixel aspect ratio isn't propagated correctly to the view, which means the view doesn't resize the `Surface` correctly.\r\n\r\n@Samrobbo - I think the work you're doing in `MediaCodecVideoRenderer` should fix this bug. If you want something for testing, you can use the following in an `exolist.json`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  {\r\n    \"name\": \"Test\",\r\n    \"samples\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"name\": \"Aspect ratio playlist\",\r\n        \"playlist\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect2.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect3.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect1.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect3.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect2.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect1.ts\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"uri\": \"http://mvv.lt/exoplayer/aspect2.ts\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/554265932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2801856727,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjgwMTg1NjcyNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/2801856727","actor":{"login":"Samrobbo","id":8195253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTUyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8195253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo","html_url":"https://github.com/Samrobbo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samrobbo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S